CLOSES
* One structural recursion simultaneously defining state, jump-hold record
  time, and the extended internal-clock line.
* One-step memorylessness iteration at every natural record index.
* Extended stopping-line, a.s.-finiteness, and stopped-history measurability
  for every recursive line.
* `FreshResidualsAt` for the full diagonal record at every index.
* A packaged extended filtration realization ready for the record-law wrapper.

